OL,3,GNEWSA'Stinky' landfill to be sealed
OL,4,A'within days'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to seal a landfill site which has
OL,7,Fbeen the subject of complaints that it
OL,8,Fis causing a bad smell, likened to
OL,9,Frotten eggs, will be completed "within
OL,10,Fthe next few days", the operator has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe site on Jameson Road, in Fleetwood,
OL,14,FLancashire, has sparked more than
OL,15,F20,000 complaints about the smell
OL,16,Femanating from it, with some nearby
OL,17,Fresidents claiming it had affected
OL,18,Ftheir health.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
