OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1787986546
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Stinky' landfill to be sealed
OL,4,A'within days'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTranswaste said "excellent progress"
OL,7,Fhad been made towards resolving the
OL,8,Fissue, and works on a permanent
OL,9,Fcovering "are 99% complete".
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency (EA), which has
OL,12,Fpressed Transwaste to install capping
OL,13,Fto prevent the smells, acknowledged the
OL,14,Flevel of complaints has fallen.
